stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> preparing
  preparing : preparing
  nextDocument : nextDocument
  document : run one document (step document; logs ingest.started ingest.parsed ingest.chunked ingest.embedded)
  extras : embed other documents that lack vectors (step embed-others; logs ingest.embedded)
  gate : gate
  committing : commit the documents and the build (step commit; logs ingest.completed build.created)
  done : done
  failed : failed
  preparing --> failed : always [spaceMismatch]
  preparing --> nextDocument : always
  nextDocument --> document : always [hasDocument]
  nextDocument --> extras : always
  document --> failed : done [documentFailed]
  document --> nextDocument : done
  document --> failed : error
  extras --> gate : done
  extras --> failed : error
  gate --> failed : always [unembeddedLeft]
  gate --> committing : always
  committing --> done : done
  committing --> failed : error
  done --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
